            "review_text": "khackien\nHanoi, Vietnam96 contributions\n0\nShouldn't come\nDec 2023 • Friends\nReally regret choosing this restaurant. You will have to climb to the 3rd floor. The space is a bit stuffy, the food is below average quality and the price is not cheap (bill 5.5 million for 10 people).\nWhen booking, the restaurant said there was a 15% discount on the total bill, but when paying, it only reduced 30% of the lowest item (100k off).\n\nThe restaurant hooks you with a 20% off coupon for your next visit (sorry there won't be another one)\nThe money spent is not worth the quality and the reviews on tiktok are hired for PR\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten December 21, 2023",
